Note on the bundled data
------------------------
Everything under bench/results/demo/ was produced by bench/mock_server.py, a
CPU-only simulator. The latencies, throughputs and GPU counters there are
SYNTHETIC and must not be cited as measurements of any real model, engine or
accelerator. They exist to exercise the pipeline and to document report format.
